        {
          "text": "Njoobabusizya musinsimi, akati kababunyina uuli mbuli nduwe, Elyo njoobika majwi aangu mumulomo wakwe, nkabela uyoobaambila makani oonse ngendamulailila. ",
          "type": "text",
